# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.

# Horde 12-30 in the order the quest levels fit (2026-11-07): the first Ashenvale visit at 21,
# straight from the Barrens, then Orgrimmar and the ride through Silverpine Forest to Hillsbrad.
# Stonetalon's road quests are in forever/horde/02-the-barrens (the Webwinder Path at 20-21),
# Sun Rock Retreat and the peak in forever/horde/04-the-barrens (at 24-25). The guide keeps its id.
#
# Flow: north across the Barrens to Kadrak at the Mor'shan Rampart (Report to Kadrak) ->
# Splintertree Post (flight path) -> Night Run (Ashenvale Hunt)
# -> west across Ashenvale, Va'xug Firefure's ravine on the way -> Zoram'gar Outpost (flight path,
# naga heads) -> Thistlefur Village and Hold -> Zoram'gar, Vorsha the Lasher ->
# fly to Splintertree
# (Ruul's hand-in) -> the lumber camp south of it (Ashenvale Outrunners) -> fly to Orgrimmar
# (training) -> zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades -> the Sepulcher (Allister's two
# road quests, Journey to Hillsbrad) -> the roads around Ambermill and Beren's Peril (the
# Offering Stone) -> Southpoint Tower for forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills.
#
# Thistlefur at 21: Troll Charm, Between a Rock and a Thistlefur and Freedom to Ruul are done from
# Zoram'gar on this visit (the old chain took them at 23 and carried them through Stonetalon and
# Hillsbrad to the 27 visit). The Sapphires, Torek, Pixel and Senani's hunt
# targets are level 23-27 and wait for the second visit at 26; none is taken now and carried.
#
# Ashenvale Outrunners (level 24, Outrunners 23-24) waits for the way back from Thistlefur, after
# Ruul's hand-in at Splintertree, where the route has the character at 22-23: taken at the lumber
# camp on the way in at 21, it put the pace line's "Behind" in front of every start but Skyborne.
#
# The Undercity flight path is learned at the end of forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest; the way
# to Tarren Mill without its flight path is the road through Silverpine, which passes Deathstalker
# Lesh: Time To Strike (494) is picked up there and handed to Darthalia on arrival in the next
# guide.
#
# Added: Never Coming Back and A Void Path (98251, 98252, Forever): Va'xug Firefure's ravine lies
# just south of the road the route rides west to Zoram'gar, and his stags and bears (21-22) suit
# the level here. The Offering Stone, The Tortured Soul and The Offering of Blood (95884, 95883,
# 95885, Forever): all three start and end at the Offering Stone in Beren's Peril, a short ride off
# the road to Tarren Mill. The Offering of Blood is optional: Forever's quest data lists it as
# elite. Beren's Peril (516) and Watching the Roads (95981), Allister's level 20-21 quests, on the
# same ride; Allister takes them on the walk from Tarren Mill to the Undercity in the next guide.
#
# Left out: The Warsong Reports (6543): its Outrider east of Night Run and the hand-in back at
# Kadrak after Thistlefur cost about 3.3 km of walking for 1,800 XP (final route review, measured:
# 0.3 hours sooner to 60 on every Horde branch without it).
#
# Carried on, finished: Beren's Peril and Watching the Roads (Allister, next guide).
#
# Class quests: Rogues take Deep Cover (2458, from Shenthul in Orgrimmar at 20) to Taskmaster Fizzule
# by the Venture Co. tower north of the Sludge Fen on the way north, a short walk east of the road to
# Kadrak, and hand Mission: Possible But Not Probable (2478, optional: Gallywix is elite) to Shenthul on
# the Orgrimmar stop. Warlocks bind the succubus (The Binding, 1513) on the Orgrimmar stop. Tauren
# Druids carrying Trial of the Sea Lion (30, from forever/horde/02-the-barrens) open the Strange
# Lockbox off the coast west of the Dead Field on the way to the Sepulcher: its Half Pendant of
# Aquatic Endurance drops only while the quest is in the log (#1386). The pendant is joined and
# handed in at the end of the next guide.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Sludge Fen (Rogues)

step Taskmaster Fizzule
  only Rogue
  zone The Barrens
  tip On the way north from Seereth's camp, keep east of the road to the Venture Co. tower north of the Sludge Fen. Before you go near Fizzule, use {item:8051} to fire two flares, then target him and /salute: he attacks anyone who comes in without signalling first.
  turnin 2458                         -- Taskmaster Fizzule
  accept 2478 optional
  note Mission: Possible But Not Probable is for level 23 or more: the tower's drones are 25 and Gallywix a 23 elite. Do it when you can, with a group, from the Class guide Poisons (Horde).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mor'shan Rampart
step Kadrak
  # The Mor'shan Rampart is in the Barrens (Forever's quest data; AreaTable 1703):
  # on Ashenvale's map the route sent you through the zone crossing past him (#246).
  zone The Barrens
  tip From Seereth's camp head north-east across the Barrens to the road north of the Crossroads. Kadrak stands on the watch tower of the Mor'shan Rampart where the road enters Ashenvale.
  turnin 6541                         -- Kadrak

step Into Ashenvale
  zone Ashenvale
  goto 71.1,68.1 "The road north to Splintertree Post"

step Splintertree Post
  tip Splintertree Post is just north up the road. Coming in from the south, the flight master and Senani Thunderheart's hunt board at Night Run come first, then the vendors. Kuray'bin at the lumber camp offers Ashenvale Outrunners: leave it for the way back, at 22.
  getfp "Splintertree Post"
  turnin 6382                         -- Senani Thunderheart
  accept 6383
  turnin 6383
  note Senani's hunt targets (Ursangous, Shadumbra, Sharptalon) are for the next Ashenvale visit, at 26.
  vendor nearest

step Va'xug Firefure
  tip On the way west, Va'xug Firefure is stuck in a ravine south of the main road, south-east of Astranaar. Shadowhorn Stags and Ashenvale Bears roam the woods all around it.
  accept 98251 @40.4,61.5             -- Va'xug Firefure
  kill 3817 quest 98251.1
  kill 3809 quest 98251.2
  turnin 98251
  accept 98252

step A Void Path
  tip Steer Va'xug's Eye of Kilrogg out of the ravine to the main road within four minutes; if the channel breaks, ask Va'xug again.
  turnin 98252 @38.2,58.1             -- Eye of Kilrogg, on the road

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Zoram'gar Outpost

step Zoram'gar Outpost
  tip Head west along the main road across Ashenvale, past Astranaar (Alliance: keep to the road), to the coast. Zoram'gar Outpost is on the Zoram Strand in the north-west: Marukai, Mitsuwa and Karang Amakkar stand around it, the Warsong Runner beside the flight master. Its other quests are for the next visit, at 26.
  getfp "Zoram'gar Outpost"
  accept 6442                         -- Marukai
  accept 6462                         -- Mitsuwa: the troll charms are in Thistlefur Hold, east of the outpost
  accept 216                          -- Karang Amakkar
  accept 6641                         -- Muglash: take it last, his escort starts at once

step Vorsha the Lasher
  tip Muglash walks north up the strand to a naga brazier. Put the brazier out, then guard him through the naga waves until Vorsha is dead; the Wrathtail naga drop the heads Marukai wants.
  goto 9.6,27.6 "Naga brazier"
  complete 6641

step Naga heads
  tip Every Wrathtail naga along the strand north of the outpost drops heads.
  collect 5490 quest 6442

step Zoram'gar Outpost
  tip Back to the outpost before heading east to Thistlefur.
  turnin 6641                         -- Warsong Runner
  turnin 6442                         -- Marukai

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thistlefur

step Thistlefur Village
  tip East of Zoram'gar, the Thistlefur furbolgs fill the village and the hills around their hold.
  tip Careful: A Shaman at 15% health or lower runs off to find help, which can pull extra furbolgs.
  kill 3925 quest 216.1
  kill 3924 quest 216.2

step Thistlefur Hold
  tip Inside the hold, Troll Chests lie along the tunnels. Ruul Snowhoof is held deep inside: free him and protect him all the way out, then he runs home to Night Run.
  tip Careful: Two scripted ambushes occur, each made up of three Thistlefurs (a Shaman, a Pathfinder and an Avenger, Ursa or Den Watcher): the first when you come back to the tunnel's fork inside the cave, the second just beyond the gate where Dal Bloodclaw roams.
  collect 16602 quest 6462            -- Below ground
  accept 6482                         -- Ruul Snowhoof, below ground
  complete 6482

step Zoram'gar Outpost
  tip Back west to Zoram'gar. Karang offers King of the Foulweald now; leave it for the next Ashenvale visit at 26, when the walk east passes the Foulweald.
  turnin 216                          -- Karang Amakkar
  turnin 6462                         -- Mitsuwa

step Splintertree Post
  tip Fly to Splintertree Post: Yama Snowhoof waits in the inn for news of Ruul.
  fly "Splintertree Post"
  turnin 6482                         -- Yama Snowhoof, inside the inn

step Ashenvale Outrunners
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Out of the inn and south down the road to the lumber camp: Kuray'bin stands there. The night elf Outrunners (23-24) stalk the woods south-east of it; they stealth, so watch for them.
  accept 6503
  kill 12856 quest 6503 @72.5,69.5 map 1440
  turnin 6503

step Fly to Orgrimmar
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Back north up the road to the Splintertree Post flight master and fly to Orgrimmar.
  goto 73.26,61.67 "Splintertree Post flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  zone Orgrimmar

step Druid trainer
  only Druid
  train class only Druid -- Sheal Runetotem in Mulgore; Orgrimmar has no druid trainer

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar at 22
step Orgrimmar
  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  zone Orgrimmar
  train class

step The Binding
  only Warlock
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Gan'rul Bloodeye stands in the Cleft of Shadow. Use Dogran's Pendant on the summoning circle there and defeat the succubus to bind her.
  turnin 1512
  accept 1513
  use 6626 @49.4,50.0                 -- Dogran's Pendant
  kill 5677 quest 1513.1
  turnin 1513

step Shenthul
  zone Orgrimmar
  only Rogue
  when complete 2478
  tip If you did Mission: Possible But Not Probable with a group, Shenthul in the Cleft of Shadow takes it now.
  turnin 2478                         -- Shenthul, Cleft of Shadow
  accept 2479                         -- Serge Hinott in Tarren Mill teaches Poisons: keep it

step Zeppelin to Undercity
  zone Durotar
  goto 50.8,13.5 "Zeppelin to Undercity"

step Brill
  only Paladin
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Shari Stilwell trains Paladins in Brill, a short walk north up the road from the zeppelin towers. Come back down the same road for Silverpine.
  train class

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Silverpine Forest

step Strange Lockbox
  only Tauren,Druid
  zone Silverpine Forest
  when onquest 30
  tip From the zeppelin towers, run south into Silverpine and west past the Dead Field to the coast: the Strange Lockbox lies at the bottom of very deep water there, beside an air fissure where you can breathe. Watch your breath on the way down. It holds the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance for Trial of the Sea Lion. Then on to the Sepulcher.
  collect 15882                         -- Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance, from the Strange Lockbox

step The Sepulcher
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip From the zeppelin towers, run south through Tirisfal into Silverpine and down the road to the Sepulcher. Shadow Priest Allister and Apothecary Renferrel stand by the crypt entrance.
  accept 493                          -- Apothecary Renferrel: Lydon in Tarren Mill, next guide
  accept 95981                        -- Shadow Priest Allister
  accept 516                          -- Shadow Priest Allister: Beren's Peril, south-east of Ambermill

step Silverpine Forest: kill these as you meet them
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip South down the road past Pyrewood: Dalaran Watchers and Wizards patrol the roads around Ambermill, and south-west of the town the Ravenclaw Drudgers and Guardians haunt the ruins of Beren's Peril in the south-east of the forest.
  kill 1889 quest 95981.2
  kill 1888 quest 95981.1
  kill 1973 quest 516.2               -- Below ground
  kill 1974 quest 516.1

step Beren's Peril
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip The Ravenclaw undead haunt the ruins of Beren's Peril, east of the road in the south-east of the forest; a Ravenclaw Guardian drops the Note Scrap that leads to the Offering Stone.
  tip An elite spirit (20) often stands beside the Offering Stone: pull the Ravenclaws away from the stone before you fight them.
  accept 95884 item 271343            -- Note Scrap, from a Ravenclaw Guardian
  turnin 95884 @58.1,69.8             -- Offering Stone
  accept 95883                        -- the Offering Stone offers The Tortured Soul once the Note Scrap is in; below ground
  collect 271350 quest 95883.1 @58.1,69.9 map 1421 -- Tortured Soul, from the Tortured Souls among the ruins; below ground
  turnin 95883                        -- Below ground

step The Offering of Blood
  tip The quest hands you a Tortured Soul: use it beside the Offering Stone to offer your blood, then kill the elite spirit that answers.
  tip The Tortured Soul is elite: grouping up is advised.
  goto 58.1,69.8 "Offering Stone"
  accept 95885 optional               -- Below ground
  use 210713 optional @58.1,69.8 map 1421 -- Tortured Soul, beside the Offering Stone: summons the elite spirit
  kill 212753 quest 95885.3 optional
  turnin 95885 optional               -- Below ground

step Into Hillsbrad
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  goto 20.8,47.4 "The road east to Southpoint Tower"

step Southpoint Tower
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Back on the road south. Where it turns east into Hillsbrad, Deathstalker Lesh waits at Southpoint Tower.
  accept 494                          -- Deathstalker Lesh: Darthalia in Tarren Mill
